::  name       mantra diff field count
::  shape      fields - int (@u32)
::  invariant  a Diff carries exactly two fields (inserts · deletes)
::  example    2
::  readers    Mantra · Glow Tend · Sur museum · Ashvini nest-only
::  nib        equinox-e205-mantra-tend-v0
::
::  Equinox e205 · Mantra M3 — third Mantra structure pedestal in src/sur/.
::  Names Diff's field count from mantra/src/weave.rye: the ordered insert
::  texts and the delete positions. Pedestal only; Rye still owns advance.
+$  mantra-diff-field-count-shape
  $:  fields=@u32
